### MODEL (turn 3)
Money in `shop/` is now integer cents throughout: `Item.price_cents`, `tax.RATES_BP` with the half-up integer tax and discount formulas, `fmt.money` on cents, and the CLI reading `price_cents`. The test suite passes (8 tests), and a grep finds no `float`, `round(`, or decimal literals left in `shop/`. I updated the existing tests to cents and added cases for the half-up rounding, the FIVEOFF threshold, and unknown coupons and regions.
